67
00:08:47.610 --> 00:08:50.385
Option A: Children of estate owners.

68
00:08:50.385 --> 00:08:52.860
Option B: Children of workers.

69
00:08:52.860 --> 00:08:55.536
Option C: Children of farmers.
[DA] Hvilken gruppe unge var der flest af på højskolerne i 1800-tallet?  A: Godsejernes børn  |  B: Arbejdernes børn  |  C: Bøndernes børn

70
00:09:02.086 --> 00:09:04.836
The answer is C: Children of farmers.

71
00:09:04.786 --> 00:09:07.386
It appeared in the June 2020 exam.
[DA] ✔ C: Bøndernes børn

72
00:09:07.936 --> 00:09:09.186
Question 2.

73
00:09:09.136 --> 00:09:13.473
Which movement did Grundtvig have a special importance for in the 1800s?

74
00:09:13.473 --> 00:09:16.386
Option A: The folk high school movement.

75
00:09:16.386 --> 00:09:18.673
Option B: The labour movement.

76
00:09:18.673 --> 00:09:21.420
Option C: The resistance movement.
[DA] Hvilken bevægelse fik Grundtvig i særlig grad betydning for i 1800-tallet?  A: Højskolebevægelsen  |  B: Arbejderbevægelsen  |  C: Modstandsbevægelsen

77
00:09:27.970 --> 00:09:31.045
The answer is A: The folk high school movement.

78
00:09:30.995 --> 00:09:33.678
It appeared in the November 2020 exam.
[DA] ✔ A: Højskolebevægelsen

79
00:09:34.128 --> 00:09:36.000
Question 3.

80
00:09:36.000 --> 00:09:41.784
Which of the following persons gave inspiration in the 1800s to the founding of folk high schools?

81
00:09:41.784 --> 00:09:44.304
Option A: Thomas Kingo.

82
00:09:44.304 --> 00:09:46.728
Option B: Johannes V.

83
00:09:46.728 --> 00:09:48.600
Jensen.

84
00:09:48.600 --> 00:09:50.856
Option C: N.F.S.

85
00:09:50.856 --> 00:09:52.728
Grundtvig.
[DA] Hvilken af følgende personer gav i 1800-tallet inspiration til oprettelsen af folkehøjskoler?  A: Thomas Kingo  |  B: Johannes V. Jensen  |  C: N.F.S. Grundtvig

86
00:09:59.178 --> 00:10:01.506
The answer is C: N.F.S.

87
00:10:01.506 --> 00:10:03.378
Grundtvig.

88
00:10:03.378 --> 00:10:07.770
It appeared in the June 2021 and May 2023 exams.
[DA] ✔ C: N.F.S. Grundtvig

89
00:10:08.220 --> 00:10:10.092
Question 4.

90
00:10:10.092 --> 00:10:13.956
Who wrote a large number of the hymns in Den Danske Salmebog?

91
00:10:13.956 --> 00:10:16.260
Option A: Herman Bang.

92
00:10:16.260 --> 00:10:18.492
Option B: Ludvig Holberg.

93
00:10:18.492 --> 00:10:20.748
Option C: N.F.S.

94
00:10:20.748 --> 00:10:22.620
Grundtvig.
[DA] Hvem har skrevet et stort antal af salmerne i Den Danske Salmebog?  A: Herman Bang  |  B: Ludvig Holberg  |  C: N.F.S. Grundtvig

95
00:10:29.070 --> 00:10:31.398
The answer is C: N.F.S.

96
00:10:31.398 --> 00:10:33.270
Grundtvig.

97
00:10:33.270 --> 00:10:37.878
